    value: '{0:SimpleNumber}'
  - key: POKER_PAYTABLE_PAYOUT_TITLE
    value: '{0}'
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Keno Golden Mind
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Card: 100</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>100 Play Bet</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_TITLE_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>How to Play</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "<size=22>- Player can play Keno Golden Mine once bet is set up.\r\n- Before
      playing Keno Golden Mine, one chooses 10 numbers from 1 to 80.\r\n- Once clicking
      PLAY button, 20 balls with random numbers from 1 to 80 are drawn. \r\n- If the
      numbers of dropped balls match with 10 numbers player chose, then player wins.\r\n-
      Depending on the number of matching numbers, win pay varies.\r \r</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_TITLE_2
    value: <style=title><size=32>Payout Table</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_2_1
    value: Hit
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_TITLE_3
    value: <style=title><size=32>DYNAMITE FEATURE</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: "<size=22>- Once game begins, one of the 10 numbers player chose turns
      to Dynamite.\n- After 20 balls are drawn, if Dynamite is part of the winning
      numbers, then Dynamite \n   explodes, awarding additional 2-5 random numbers
      on the board.\n    - Numbers of new balls from Dynamite Feature are directly
      created on the board\n       except where the numbers from 20 balls already
      occupy.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_TITLE_4_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>GOLD RUSH</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_4_1
    value: "<size=20>- Once game begins, except the numbers player chose, 3 random
      numbers on the board are \n    automatically selected as Special Spots.\n- If
      all 3 Special Spots are part of winning numbers with 20 balls or additional
      2-5 balls from \n    Dynamite Feature, then Gold Rush Bonus Game is triggered.\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_TITLE_4_2
    value: <style=title><size=32>GOLD RUSH BONUS GAME</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_4_2
    value: "<size=18\x03>- When Gold Rush Bonus Game is triggered, the numbers player
      chose get locked and 10 spins are awarded.\n- During Gold Rush Bonus Game, player
      cannot change the numbers.\n- During Gold Rush Bonus Game, every spin, 1-3 random
      numbers on the board turn to Dynamites. \n- Each winning Dynamite(s) awards
      additional 2-5 numbers on the board except where the numbers from \n    20 balls
      already occupy.\n- When Dynamite(s) explodes and awards extra numbers, duplicate
      numbers cannot be selected.\n- Once there is no remaining spins, Gold Rush Bonus
      Game ends.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_TITLE_5
    value: <style=title><size=32>JACKPOT</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_5
    value: "<size=22\x03>- If 10 numbers player chose match with 20 drawn balls or
      additional numbers from \n   Dynamite Feature, then award Jackpot. </size>"
